Privacy Policy

Last updated: April 2026

Love Birds respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your information when you use our app.

1. Information We Collect

When you use Love Birds, we may collect the following information:

Name
Email address
Profile photo
Relationship start date
Partner name and image if you add them manually
Memories, notes, moods, bucket list items, places, and other content you save in the app
Device and app usage information for security, analytics, and app improvement

2. How We Use Your Information

We use your information to:

Create and manage your account
Show your profile and partner details
Save your memories, notes, moods, places, and relationship information
Allow connected partners to share couple features
Improve app performance and user experience
Protect your account and prevent unauthorized access
Provide support when you contact us

3. Solo Use and Partner Connection

You can use Love Birds by yourself without connecting a partner.

If you connect with a partner, both users may access shared couple content, including memories, notes, moods, bucket list items, places, and relationship details.

If your partner has not joined yet, you may add their name or image as preview data. Once your partner joins, their real profile details may be shown from their own account.

4. Shared Couple Data

When you are connected with a partner, shared data may be visible to both users in the couple space.

This may include:

Memories
Notes
Mood updates
Bucket list items
Places visited
Important dates
Widgets
Relationship details

Please only add content that you are comfortable sharing with your connected partner.

5. How We Store Your Data

We use Firebase and related cloud services to store and manage app data.

Images may be stored using secure cloud image storage services.

We use authentication and database security rules to help protect your data from unauthorized access.

6. Data Sharing

We do not sell your personal information.

We do not make your memories, notes, or relationship data public.

We may share limited data only when needed to:

Operate the app
Store images and app content
Provide analytics and crash reporting
Comply with legal requirements
Protect the safety and security of users

7. Third-Party Services

Love Birds may use third-party services such as:

Firebase Authentication
Cloud Firestore
Firebase Storage or other image storage services
Firebase Analytics
Crash reporting tools
Payment or subscription services if premium features are added

These services may collect information according to their own privacy policies.

8. Profile Updates

When you update your name or profile photo, your connected partner may see the updated details.

Your real profile information is stored in your user account. Partner preview data is only used when the partner has not joined yet.

9. Disconnecting From a Partner

You can disconnect from your partner at any time.

When you disconnect:

Your account is removed from the couple connection
Your personal profile is not deleted
Your partner’s profile is not deleted
Shared couple data may remain unless deleted separately

10. Account and Data Deletion

You may request to delete your account or personal data.

When your account is deleted, we will take reasonable steps to remove or anonymize your personal information, unless we need to keep certain data for legal, security, or operational reasons.

Shared couple content may need to be deleted separately, especially if it belongs to a shared couple space.

11. Children’s Privacy

Love Birds is not intended for children under 13 years old.

We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If we discover that a child has provided personal information, we will take steps to delete it.

12. Security

We take reasonable steps to protect your information.

However, no online service is completely secure. You are responsible for keeping your login details safe and only sharing invite codes with people you trust.

13. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time.

If we make major changes, we may notify you inside the app or through other reasonable methods.

14. Contact Us

If you have any questions, concerns, or requests about this Privacy Policy, contact us at:

support@lovebirdsapp.com
